          "claim": "Travel2 trips/left p95 rose to about 5.3 s, with 48 erroring server spans, during seat saturation (normal p95 about 343 ms)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-seat-service",
      "to": "ts-travel-service",
