          "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, count(*) n, round(quantile_cont(c.duration,0.95)/1e6,1) callee_p95_ms, sum(CASE WHEN p.attr_status_code='Error' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) caller_err FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.trace_id=p.trace_id AND c.parent_span_id=p.span_id WHERE p.service_name<>c.service_name AND p.attr_span_kind='Client' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' AND c.service_name='ts-travel-service' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Travel's trip detail and trips/left server spans slow to several seconds, with error spans, while calling seat."
